title: Demo_Dialogue
position: 308,34
---
This is an example of a Yarn Spinner script. Write your dialogue here!
===
title: loadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase = "">>
<<dialoguePhaseSet "NPC">>
<<declare $questSeen = false>>
<<if $dialoguePhase == "start">>
<<jump Start>>
<<else>>
Farmer: I don't know what to do. This is an error debug message. fix ur shit loser
<<endif>>
===
title: Start
---
<<if $questSeen == true>>
<<jump questSeen>>
<<endif>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Hello! How are you?
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->I'm good!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Farmer: Awesome! I'm doing pretty good myself.
        Farmer: However, I would be doing better if I had some more corn.
        Farmer: I'm making cornbread for the wife and I tonight. But I actually haven't picked any.
        <<jump GiveQuest>>
    ->I'm okay.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
        Farmer: Cool. The weather is pretty nice out.
        Farmer: So nice out, it makes me want to make cornbread!
        Farmer: The thing is, I actually don't have enough corn.
        <<jump GiveQuest>>
===
title: GiveQuest
---
Farmer: Would you mind picking 3 corn from our farm?
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Sure.
        <<jump DescribeLocation>>>>
    ->Why would I do that?
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Farmer: I was going to give you some bread. But I guess not with that attitude.
        Farmer: Just kidding. But I'll let you have some if you get me 3 pieces okay?
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
            ->Okay.
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
                <<jump DescribeLocation>>>>
===

title: DescribeLocation
---
<<set $questSeen to true>>
Farmer: Our farm is out the door you came to the left. There should be some already growing.
Farmer: If not, there are some seeds you can plant.
Farmer: Remember I need 3 pieces!
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Sounds good.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: questSeen
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Hello again!
Farmer: In case you forgot, I'm looking for 3 pieces of corn to finish this cornbread im making.
Farmer: Let me know if you find any!
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Okay!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===
